      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1855 - Muhammad ibn Muslim narrated from Imam (as) that Imam (as) said:\n\"When you fast, let your hearing, your sight, your hair, and your skin also fast,\" and Imam mentioned other things besides these.\nImam (as) also said: \"The day of your fast should not be like the day when you are not fasting.\""
        ]
